    26	// GetNextChildID generates the next hierarchical child ID for a given parent
    27	// Returns formatted ID as parentID.{counter} (e.g., bd-a3f8e9.1 or bd-a3f8e9.1.5)
    28	// Works at any depth (max 3 levels)
