14895|farmplanner-r3yq.8.33|created|ben||{"id":"farmplanner-r3yq.8.33","title":"Promote VISOR 89167-40 as correction batch 1b","description":"## Given/When/Then\n**Given:** bug bead farmplanner-r3yq.8.35 is merged (dependency crops validated against the canonical vocabulary), VISOR_S-MOC_89167-40-89391's correction_v2 (`artifacts/corrections_v42/VISOR_S-MOC_89167-40-89391/correction_v2.json`, rye renamed to cereal rye in rate_dependencies[2], otherwise byte-identical to the v4-accepted correction_v1) has receipt `data_runs/corrections_v42/VISOR_S-MOC_89167-40-89391/receipt_v2.json` and an accepted verification report `artifacts/rates_correction_v42/VISOR_S-MOC_89167-40-89391.v5.md` bound in `artifacts/correction_judge_receipts_v43.json`, and its labeled_crops repair is already live (receipt under `data_runs/crop_repairs_v42/VISOR_S-MOC_89167-40-89391.*.json`, applied in batch 1).\n**When:** the agent machine-checks the v5 verification JSON exactly as bead 8.20's Contract says, verifies the live record's `labeled_crops` already equals correction_v2 operation `labeled_crops` `after` (skip `promote_crop_repairs.py`; a mismatch is `held: crop repair drift`), snapshots the live file, builds the review manifest for this one stem with `--run batch1b`, assembles, validates and promotes it, then validates the live result.\n**Then:** exactly this stem is promoted with its corrected_v2 rate fields (91 rows, rate_dependencies replaced with three entries) and scoped `_reviews`; every other product is byte-identical to the snapshot; the report `artifacts/rates_promotion_v42_batch1b.md` follows 8.20's report contract with `run=batch1b`, and bead 8.27 counts `batch1b` as a subset promotion report.\n## Touches\n- `work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/data_runs/rates_review_v42_batch1b.json`\n- `work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/data_runs/rates_targets_v42_batch1b.json`\n- `work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/data_runs/rates_manifest_v42_batch1b.json`\n- `work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/artifacts/rates_evidence_v42/*`\n- `work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/artifacts/rates_promotion_v42_batch1b.md`\n## Contract\n- Same Contract as farmplanner-r3yq.8.20 (`bd show farmplanner-r3yq.8.20`), for the single stem, with `--run batch1b` and the receipt/report versions named above; the five-label transformation sentence records that VISOR 89167-40 is now covered.\n- The bead never edits a report, receipt or correction; a failed check holds the stem by name and writes the report with `rates_promoted=0`.\n## Acceptance\n- Run every command below from the root of the current run checkout (the builder's worktree), never a hard-coded item checkout; absolute `/home/ben/projects/farmplanner/...` paths name authorized live data only.\n- [ ] `grep -qE '^rates_promoted=[0-9]+ run=batch1b held=[0-9]+ staged_sha256=([0-9a-f]{64}|none) live_sha256_before=[0-9a-f]{64} live_sha256_after=[0-9a-f]{64}$' work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/artifacts/rates_promotion_v42_batch1b.md`\n- [ ] `n=$(grep -oE '^rates_promoted=[0-9]+' work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/artifacts/rates_promotion_v42_batch1b.md | cut -d= -f2); [ \"$n\" = 0 ] || uv run python scripts/promote_rates.py validate --products /home/ben/projects/farmplanner/data/production/products.json --manifest work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/data_runs/rates_manifest_v42_batch1b.json | grep -q '^PASS validate'`\n- [ ] `! grep -qiE 'assumed|inferred acceptance' work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/artifacts/rates_promotion_v42_batch1b.md \u0026\u0026 grep -qE '^(- )?VISOR_S-MOC_89167-40-89391: (promoted|held: )' work/w893_edition-dedup-copy/artifacts/rates_promotion_v42_batch1b.md`\n","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-09-09T18:19:40.766311995+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-09T18:19:40.766311995+02:00"}||2026-09-09 16:19:40
